// End-to-end type class dispatch test.
// Verifies that built-in class instances compile
// and dispatch correctly through the VM pipeline.
//
// The instances the prelude already supplies are not redeclared here. Since
// Proposal 0179 Stage 8 the standard classes are Flux source in `Flow.Eq`,
// `Flow.Num` and `Flow.Show`, which every module imports, so `Int` and `Bool`
// arrive with their instances; declaring them again is a duplicate instance.
// The calls below dispatch through those prelude instances.




fn main() with IO {
    print(show(42))
    print(add(10, 20))
    print(mul(3, 7))
    print(div(84, 2))
    print(eq(1, 1))
    print(eq(1, 2))
    print(neq(1, 1))
    print(neq(1, 2))
}